https://doi.org/10.1038/s41597-020-00712-x
Source: https://github.com/buds-lab/building-data-genome-project-2

Changes: selected hourly BDG2 readings and metadata; derived model predictions,
estimated floor allocations, synthetic PV/storage/grid data, and log-only dispatch.
Contract1.3 adds selected chilledwater_cleaned.csv and steam_cleaned.csv readings,
thermal kWh/1h interpretation, bounded past-only fill, origin persistence,
building-only fan/secondary-pump auxiliary electricity derived from explicit
EnergyPlus-based assumptions (district cooling/heating production excluded),
electric-load caps, estimated floor HVAC/non-HVAC partitions and energy shares.
Raw thermal data are SHA256 checked against official LFS pointers; see
experiments/bdg2_thermal_sources.json and docs/hvac_meter_contract.md.
No measured HVAC electrical submeter or calibrated savings are claimed.
These additional data adaptations are also CC BY-SA 4.0; preserve attribution,
license links and modifications on redistribution. See THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.
sample.json is authored mock data, not measured BDG2 readings.
